{
  "total_ms": 72350,
  "total_chars": 292,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "微信突然弹出一条消息：多年没联系的老同学，孩子结婚，请您去喝喜酒。",
      "chars": 33,
      "speech_ms": 8160,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 8160,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "去吧，几十年没来往，坐那儿跟谁都聊不上；不去吧，又怕人说不念旧情。",
      "chars": 33,
      "speech_ms": 8150,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 8560,
      "end_ms": 16710,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这事其实就看两样。",
      "chars": 9,
      "speech_ms": 1670,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 17110,
      "end_ms": 18780,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第一看交情：当年是真有过交情、只是各忙各的，这种帖该去，去了，老交情还能续上；要是当年就没说过几句话、群发式的请帖，回句祝福，不去也不亏心。",
      "chars": 70,
      "speech_ms": 18000,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 19180,
      "end_ms": 37180,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "随礼就一条：多年不来往的，按普通交情走，不撑面子，也不特殊。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6590,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 37580,
      "end_ms": 44170,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第二看回话：去不去都早给人准信，人家要按人数订桌，您拖着不吭声，就是给人添乱。",
      "chars": 39,
      "speech_ms": 9790,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 44570,
      "end_ms": 54360,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "《中国式人情世故》讲的就是这个理：交情在平时的往来里，不在临时的热闹里。",
      "chars": 36,
      "speech_ms": 7650,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 54760,
      "end_ms": 62410,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "平时不往来，临时抱佛脚，抱的不是交情，是尴尬。",
      "chars": 23,
      "speech_ms": 5000,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 62810,
      "end_ms": 67810,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这样的请帖，您收到过吗？",
      "chars": 12,
      "speech_ms": 2370,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 68210,
      "end_ms": 70580,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "最后去了没有？",
      "chars": 7,
      "speech_ms": 980,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 70980,
      "end_ms": 71960,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}